#: src/dialogs/sample-points.xml:92(para)
msgid ""
"Sample points are shown as a round mark with an order number. You can hide "
"these marks by unchecking "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>View</guimenu><guimenuitem>Show Sample "
"Points</guimenuitem></menuchoice> in the main menu."
msgstr ""
"Samplingspunkter markeras som runda symboler med ett ordningsnummer. Dölj "
"symbolerna genom att inaktivera "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Visa</guimenu><guimenuitem>Visa "
"samplingspunkter</guimenuitem></menuchoice> i huvudmenyn."

#: src/dialogs/sample-points.xml:100(para)
msgid ""
"The <quote>Sample Points</quote> dialog does not automatically open when you"
" create a sample point."
msgstr ""
"Dialogrutan <quote>Samplingspunkter</quote> öppnas inte automatiskt när du "
"skapar en samplingspunkt."

